### 1. LOGIN - Obtener token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "james",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 2. Crear Venue
POST http://localhost:8080/api/venues
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wi zink center",
  "location": "Madrid",
  "capacity": 10000
}

> {%
    client.global.set("venue_id", response.body.id);
%}

### 3. Guarda el token de la respuesta anterior y úsalo aquí
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### 4. Crear Event (con el venueId del paso anterior)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rock Fest",
  "date": "2026-06-10T20:00:00",
  "status": "SCHEDULED",
  "venueId": {{venue_id}}
}

> {%
    // Esto guarda el id del evento recién creado en una variable llamada event_id
    client.global.set("event_id", response.body.id);
%}

### 5. Crear ticket usando el token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": {{event_id}},
  "price": 50.0
}